      "w": 4,
      "h": 4,
      "title": "Each target · A against B"
     },
     {
      "view": "T3 by speed",
      "w": 3,
      "h": 4,
      "title": "Does it hold with speed? · median B ÷ A"
     },
     {
      "view": "T3 regressed",
